msgid "A chart counts as an LN chart when hold notes are 45% or more of it, and as a regular chart below that. On 7K the line is 37.5% instead, because its mapping culture ships hybrid charts the community reads as LN. This is the same line the maps pages use to label a chart, so a chart cannot feed your LN rating and wear a regular badge at the same time."
