#~ msgid "Twenty is enough that a few lucky passes cannot carry it. With fewer than 20 qualifying passes the average is over what you have; a skill you have fewer than four in gets no dan of its own, and a side you have fewer than four on gets no estimate at all rather than a shaky one."
